## About

Thomas Mannhart is a Professional AI Engineer at bbv Software Services AG in Zürich. He develops the bbv AI Hub — a Swiss-made enterprise AI platform — and architects customized AI solutions, especially RAG systems, for customer projects in industry and market research. He serves as technical lead (Dev Lead) on AI projects and consults customers on IT and AI strategy.

He studied Informatics at the University of Zürich (BSc in Software Systems, MSc in Artificial Intelligence). His bachelor thesis on a general-purpose range join algorithm for PostgreSQL won the UZH Semester Award. He has been shipping software professionally since 2019.

